{"name": "Litany", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Forge impossible synergies and unleash attacks that should not exist. Build a group, descend into the depths, and make the numbers go UP!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"280\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4227270/extras/7a9c11a01a56c9ecb5818d4438786af9.poster.avif?t=1784051400\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4227270/extras/7a9c11a01a56c9ecb5818d4438786af9.webm?t=1784051400\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4227270/extras/7a9c11a01a56c9ecb5818d4438786af9.mp4?t=1784051400\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combine units with powerful trinkets to form a group bound by fate, growing stronger as you confront the horrors on each floor. Your deck will twist into something unintended yet impossible to stop, unlocking new cards, characters, and relics along the way. Assemble a fellowship of heroes and face\u00a0the horrors reborn from darkness to descend and unseal the ancient door. End the eternal curse or be forever trapped in this eternal cycle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"308\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4227270/extras/bd53d1bba8528b8022975e508db0572a.poster.avif?t=1784051400\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4227270/extras/bd53d1bba8528b8022975e508db0572a.webm?t=1784051400\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4227270/extras/bd53d1bba8528b8022975e508db0572a.mp4?t=1784051400\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You wield many tools: distinct characters with unique decks and trinkets, single-use rune cards, mysterious Eyes, and powerful line and column multipliers. Combine them, break their limits, and watch a single perfect chain of effects tear through even the strongest foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"292\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4227270/extras/585fa35b7757d05dc264a704d40d9587.poster.avif?t=1784051400\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4227270/extras/585fa35b7757d05dc264a704d40d9587.webm?t=1784051400\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4227270/extras/585fa35b7757d05dc264a704d40d9587.mp4?t=1784051400\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Build and manipulate</strong> your deck, find <strong>unique synergies</strong>, and forge a strategy to overcome <strong>deadly enemies.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Combine cards, trinkets, and upgrades, positioning units to create powerful combos</strong> and achieve the best <strong>score-making engine.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Play and replay</strong> with <strong>6 different characters</strong>, each with their <strong>own strategy, cards, and trinkets.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Upgrade the shop</strong> and <strong>unlock a vast collection of hundreds</strong> of unique cards and Trinkets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face many combinations of <strong>enemies, bosses, and trials that shape each run, where no challenge is the same</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"200\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4227270/extras/32fcfc5156ab5ce168aa690429a21e15.poster.avif?t=1784051400\" width=\"700\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4227270/extras/32fcfc5156ab5ce168aa690429a21e15.webm?t=1784051400\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Improve your collection by discovering new cards, trinkets and secrets. Enjoy the hypnotic thrill of stacking buffs without restraint, watching your group surge to a level of power that feels far beyond anything a mortal should wield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4227270/extras/0908d6d39ae703834bdba27b748cab65.webp?t=1784051400\"/><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"256\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4227270/extras/0908d6d39ae703834bdba27b748cab65.poster.avif?t=1784051400\" width=\"256\"/></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Litany is a roguelike deckbuilder where you play multiple units, craft a hyper-synergistic group, and trigger results that should not exist. Pick a character, open boosters, upgrade cards, and craft a powerful combination that breaks the numbers!", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.st